msgstr ""

msgid "Nested configuration groups are built separately and composed into the parent builder:"
msgstr ""

msgid "Collections and Maps"
msgstr ""

msgid "`List`, `Set`, and `Map` types are set directly with their values:"
msgstr ""

msgid "Required Properties"
msgstr ""

msgid ""
"Properties without a `@WithDefault` are considered required. Calling `build()` throws a `NoSuchElementException` if\n"
"any required property is not set:"
msgstr ""

msgid "- Throws a `NoSuchElementException`, the `host` is required but not set"
msgstr ""

msgid "- Works as expected since the `host` value is now provided"
msgstr ""

